@JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136

GET {{JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin@jiudiary.local",
  "password": "JiuDiary2026!"
}

### Подставьте accessToken и refreshToken из ответа на запрос входа

GET {{JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

POST {{JiuDiary_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
